{"id":"u-a3973208-3e6c-404e-a83a-9e5b8c690a1c","src":"community","title":"GAB — Atletisch Masterplan","author":"GAB","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/6XbwIH-gab-atletisch-masterplan","desc":"This 16-week program is built around one goal: building a lean, athletic physique — think sprinter or CrossFitter, not bodybuilder.\n\nThe program runs on a Week A / Week B rotation, alternating every week for 16 weeks. Each week contains 4 gym sessions:\n\nDay 1 — Upper A (Monday): incline bench focus, V-taper, bicep & tricep all heads\nDay 2 — Lower A (Wednesday morning): squat focus, quad & core\nDay 3 — Upper B (Friday/Saturday): flat bench focus, full back & shoulder detail\nDay 4 — Lower B (Saturday/Sunday): RDL, posterior chain & glutes\n\nEvery session starts with a CNS primer (explosive push-ups or box jumps) to activate the nervous system before the heavy compound block. Training hits all 3 muscle fiber types: heavy compounds for Type IIb power, superset hypertrophy blocks for Type IIa, and high-rep finishers for Type I endurance.\n\nSupersets are used throughout to cut session time without reducing stimulus.\n\nDeload weeks are scheduled at Week 7 and Week 15 — same exercises, sets reduced by 40%, weight stays the same.\n\nProgressive overload via double progression: train to the top of the rep range across all sets, then add weight next session.\n\nProgram is part of a full 13–15 month transformation plan targeting 75 kg at 12% body fat.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-04-01T09:58:42.475Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper A - Maandag","Lower A - Woensdag","Upper B - Vrijdag","Lower B - Zaterdag"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Explosive Push-Ups - CNS Primer · Max Explosiviteit","sets":[{"r":5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":4}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{